{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20148","headline":"汴州留别韩愈 · 孟郊","name":"汴州留别韩愈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不饮浊水澜，空滞此汴河。\n坐见遶岸水，尽爲还海波。\n四时不在家，弊服断线多。\n远客独顦顇，春英落婆娑。\n汴水饶曲流，野桑无直柯。\n但爲君子心，叹息终靡他。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}